==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[grammar]] [[school]]}}

# {{context|archaic|lang=en}} A school that teaches its pupils the grammar system of a European language, especially [[Latin]] and [[Greek]].
# {{context|chiefly|_|UK|lang=en}} A [[secondary]] school that stresses [[academic]] over [[practical]] or [[vocational]] [[education]], until recent times open to those [[pupil]]s who had passed the [[11-plus examination]].
# {{context|US|rare|regional|lang=en}} [[elementary school|Elementary school]].

====Related terms====
* [[secondary modern school]]
* [[comprehensive school]]

